---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+13015550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(301) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Emergency Furnace Repair Laurel MD | 24/7 Same-Day Service" description="24/7 emergency furnace repair in Laurel, MD. Fast response for no-heat emergencies. Licensed technicians, upfront pricing.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Emergency Furnace Repair in Laurel, MD</h1>
      <p>When your furnace fails overnight or in freezing weather, we respond around the clock with same-day emergency service.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.25rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call Now — {phoneDisplay}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>24/7 Emergency Heat Restoration</h2>
      <p>No heat is more than an inconvenience — it can be a safety issue in Maryland winters. Our emergency furnace repair team serves Laurel and Prince George's County day and night with fully stocked vehicles and licensed technicians.</p>
      <h3>What We Handle on Emergency Calls</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Complete loss of heat</li>
        <li>Furnace won't ignite or pilot won't stay lit</li>
        <li>Strong gas smell or carbon monoxide alarm (evacuate first, then call)</li>
        <li>Blower running continuously with no heat</li>
        <li>Unusual burning smells from the unit</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>Why Choose Us for Emergencies</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Available 24 hours a day, 7 days a week</li>
        <li>Average response under 60 minutes in the Laurel area</li>
        <li>Transparent emergency rates — no surprise after-hours markups</li>
        <li>First-visit fixes whenever parts are on the truck</li>
      </ul>
      <p><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Request Emergency Service</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
